### Accounts Receivable - All invoices
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/account-receivable/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter by invoice date range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/account-receivable/?date_from=2026-10-01&date_to=2026-10-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search invoices or customers
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/account-receivable/?search=ABC
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter by status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/account-receivable/?status=overdue
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter by customer
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/account-receivable/?customer_id=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/account-receivable/?page=1&page_size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Combined filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/account-receivable/?date_from=2026-10-01&date_to=2026-10-31&status=overdue&customer_id=5&page=1&page_size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}